horde\" class=\"entity-link\">Horde</a>\n            — Orgrimmar is a leading <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde\" class=\"entity-link\">Horde</a> capital.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde/thrall\" class=\"entity-link\">Thrall</a>\n            — <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde/thrall\" class=\"entity-link\">Thrall</a> founded Orgrimmar.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde/orcs-of-azeroth\" class=\"entity-link\">Orcs</a>\n            — Orgrimmar is connected to <a href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde/orcs-of-azeroth\" class=\"entity-link\">Orcs</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Connected To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">3</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Horde</strong>\n                    <span>Coalition of orcs, trolls, tauren, Forsaken, and more.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/world-of-warcraft/azeroth/horde/thrall\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Thrall</strong>\n                  